135
00:15:49,867 --> 00:15:52,035
I'd say it's a win-win.

136
00:15:53,704 --> 00:15:56,707
Racers and mechanics gotta stick together.

137
00:15:56,707 --> 00:15:58,709
You and I have
always made a good team.

138
