YELLOWLINE, have been nominated.

159
00:17:05,692 --> 00:17:06,109
Seriously?

160
00:17:06,485 --> 00:17:07,110
What?

161
00:17:07,402 --> 00:17:09,947
They just announced
the next REDLINE's venue.

162
00:17:09,947 --> 00:17:11,907
It'll be at Roboworld. Roboworld!

163
00:17:11,907 --> 00:17:13,575
Roboworld?!

164
00:17:13,575 --> 00:17:16,161
Roboworld?

165
00:17:16,161 --> 00:17:19,873
My beloved people
of the M3 nebula!

166
00:17:19,873 --> 00:17:24,211
I will not allow the REDLINE
to enter our Roboworld!

167
00:17:24,211 --> 00:17:29,633
Shame on those REDLINE criminals
for disturbing the peace of our nebula!

168
00:17:29,633 --> 00:17:34,805
Our Roboworld exists as
a symbol of peace for humanity.

169
00:17:34,805 --> 00:17:38,517
I can never allow REDLINE
to enter this sacred place!

170
00:17:38,934 --> 00:17:41,395
Any REDLINE outsiders
who invade our territory...

171
00:17:41,395 --> 00:17:43,772
